# 🏴‍☠️ OBSIDIAN CTF 2026 – Writeups

My cybersecurity challenge documentation from **Obsidian Labs CTF 2026 – Jeopardy-Style Cybersecurity Challenge**.

This repository contains challenge notes, investigation methodologies, technical approaches, evidence analysis, and writeups covering different areas of cybersecurity, with a primary focus on **Digital Forensics**.

